      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/nov/16/gerard-depardieu-drops-appeal-against-sexual-assault-conviction",
      "description": "<p>French actor apologises to two women he was convicted of assaulting on a film set in 2021</p><p>The French actor <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/film/gerard-depardieu\">Gérard Depardieu</a> has dropped his appeal against a conviction for sexually assaulting two women on a film set, and has for the first time apologised to the victims.</p><p>“I was found guilty. I hear it and I accept this conviction,” Depardieu, 77, said in a written statement. “I address my deep and sincere apologies to those who suffered.”</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/nov/16/gerard-depardieu-drops-appeal-against-sexual-assault-conviction\">Continue reading...</a>",
